  "name": "Zul'Gurub: Mar'li's Drain Life reaches a third of the raid while she channels it",
  "contract": [
    "On live Mar'li's (14510) Drain Life drained 16 of 25 players at once; the tester asked to meet in the",
    "middle, so each Drain Life (2118105) adds 2118106 on 0.32 of the players within 100 yards, rounded, besides",
    "its target: one of four. A group of four fights a Normal Mar'li. Drain Life is a 1 s cast followed by a 5 s",
    "channel; in the Bronzebeard log of 2025-12-21 nobody got 2118106 when the cast was interrupted, and it left",
    "every player 0.25-0.9 s after the channel was. So the extra players are drained only once the channel starts,",
    "and a mage's Counterspell (2139, 100 % spell hit) on the channel ends it on all four. Infest, which this case",
    "covered on Ascended until round 5 moved it to her spider form, has its own case",
    "(zul-gurub-marli-infest-spider-form-ascended)."
  ],
